"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_20_3LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"La semaine de course est arrivée ! Il est temps de lever le pied, alors ne gâche pas tout en cherchant à te « tester » sur cette séance. Respecte ton endurance fondamentale : elle est simplement là pour te maintenir actif(ve) et éviter le désentraînement. Le travail est fait, fais-toi confiance.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_15","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":192,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1791158400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":3.4429617936172088,"expectedDuration":1200},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":900,"pace":{"value":327}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z2","duration":120,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"5KM","description":"Le travail est fait, il est temps de t'amuser ! Sur 5 km, la difficulté est souvent de trouver le bon équilibre entre partir assez vite sans se mettre dans le rouge trop tôt. Fais confiance à l'entraînement : les premières minutes doivent te sembler rapides, mais maîtrisées. Reste concentré(e) sur tes sensations et accepte l'inconfort qui arrivera progressivement. Aujourd'hui, il n'y a plus rien à construire, seulement à exprimer ce que tu as développé ces dernières semaines. Bonne course !","displayName":"5KM","coachAdvice":"L'équipe CAMPUS te souhaite bon courage pour ta compétition ! On est tous derrière toi :)","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Competition","trainingCategory":"road_competition","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"course","value":233,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":false,"slug":"race"},"durations":[{"value":1165,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":5,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1791158400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":5,"expectedDuration":1165},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z5","duration":1165,"pace":{"value":233}}]}],"weekStats":{"expectedDistance":15.460505653266331,"realDistance":0,"expectedDuration":4765,"realDuration":0},"exportStatus":"NotAvailable","goalDuration":{"durationInWeeks":8,"index":8},"coach":{"name":"Tristan","image":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1765362553-tristan-tete.png"},"access":"allowed"},{"userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","_id":"6a830ceded61b9f01c19f064","articles":["ObXpXK6XSy-fr8_aJhItFQ","SKkKvzByTEaKSdNKIAogVA","OM8_qSsPTXiQUzM6IjwyJw","Qfqe5ct2RdWTVeG_EOdZDg","fp50XhGlQMiaUp_nTdIdZA"],"weekDate":1791763200000,"context":{"priority":"performance","backgroundGoal":"speed","goalId":"6a830ca0ed61b9f01c19e536","cycleTheme":"post-competition","cycleDescription":"Ce \"bloc\" permet de t'octroyer le repos nécessaire (et mérité) après ta course, puis de reprendre progressivement avant la suite de ton plan d'entrainement.","isStatic":true},"estimatedPaces":[{"slug":"slow","value":595.4928886007459,"dvalue":40,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"moderate","value":253.39364869593157,"dvalue":11.546428012657685,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"fast","value":191.02958081308557,"dvalue":5.66702681244879,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"sprint","value":152.9477731423441,"dvalue":3.237457842651649,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"ef","value":326.15347385896416,"dvalue":19.994396352206667,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"tempo","value":298.27437903843145,"dvalue":16.59831953092556,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"sweet-spot","value":266.770018376605,"dvalue":12.993029304950714,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"aerobie","value":316.48504255130473,"dvalue":18.796339633196634,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"seuil60","value":253.39364869593157,"dvalue":11.546428012657685,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"seuil30","value":240.68799631296227,"dvalue":10.224506328860393,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"vma","value":210.7186743022832,"dvalue":7.3399347684965806,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"marathon","value":287.5696390723156,"dvalue":14.1691592073767,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"half-marathon","value":261.55445937376146,"dvalue":12.422595003828265,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"10km","value":246.35983380352266,"dvalue":10.808038495249079,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"5km","value":233.04382610124063,"dvalue":9.455735825272683,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"1500m","value":211.60241802264923,"dvalue":7.419645544861268,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"endurance-confort","value":338.7558261711192,"dvalue":21.586697317509785,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","value":326.15347385896416,"dvalue":19.994396352206667,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"endurance-active","value":316.48504255130473,"dvalue":18.796339633196634,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"vo2max","value":210.7186743022832,"dvalue":7.3399347684965806,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"race","value":233,"dvalue":9.455735825272683,"abstract":false,"competitive":true,"race":{"distance":5,"elevation":0,"goalId":"6a830ca0ed61b9f01c19e536"}}],"sessions":[{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_30","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"On retrouve les baskets pour les premiers footings. Après une première semaine post-course en douceur, on reprend ton sport favori.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":0,"weekDate":1791763200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":5.278592375366569,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1800,"pace":{"value":326}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"Recup_active_30","description":"La récupération active se fera idéalement sous forme de vélo, de natation, ski de fond ou encore une marche bien active en sentier. On ne force pas, ce n'est pas encore le moment de reprendre l'entrainement et encore moins l'impact de la course à pied.","displayName":"Récupération active","coachAdvice":"Juste histoire de rester actif. Sans forcer, la récupération avant tout.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Special","trainingCategory":"road_special","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"LENT_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":595,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z1","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1791763200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":3.0252100840336134,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z1","duration":1800,"pace":{"value":595}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_30_2","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Toujours pas d'intensité, juste pour retrouver les sensations. On retrouvera un volume plus habituel la semaine prochaine.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesB